  "findings": [
    "The fixed action defaults overwrite=false and calls its explicit artifact deletion helper only inside the overwrite=true conditional.",
    "The 2.3.2 SDK source explicitly documents reruns as a case where one public workflow run can have several artifacts with the same name.",
    "The exact pinned runtime bundle implements selection of the greatest artifact ID when several artifacts match the name; it sends backend workflow/job identifiers to CreateArtifact, not a local public-run-name uniqueness check.",
    "These sources do not justify assuming that a same-name upload in a new attempt must fail with HTTP 409.",
    "The failed attempt artifact was still listed with its original ID/digest and expired=false after the new attempt started."
  ],
